Quest Mandatory Training Follow
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- BOOM BROTHERS --------
        Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of BoomBrothers)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                IsUnitAlive[CV] Equal to True
                GCSM_UnitInCombat[CV] Equal to False
                UnitMoving[CV] Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Distance between (Position of BoomBrothers) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than 1000.00
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order BoomBrothers to Right-Click Nazgrek
                    Else - Actions
                        Unit - Order BoomBrothers to Stop.
            Else - Actions
        -------- GOBLIN MINERS --------
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in BoomBrotherGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of (Picked unit))
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        IsUnitAlive[CV] Equal to True
                        UnitMoving[CV] Equal to False
                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Goblin Miner (Level 10)
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Right-Click BoomBrothers
                    Else - Actions
